        "## Step 9 — Identify changes in measurement support over time\n",
        "\n",
        "The supplied daily series is irregular, and the number of readings behind a daily mean changes substantially over time. Rather than hard-coding regime dates, we quantify monthly median readings, the share of records with at least 12 readings, number of reporting stations, and observed dates. These metrics show whether apparent pollution changes could be entangled with changes in measurement support."
      ]
